z was popular, and the Charleston was the rage."},"style":"Extended","position":[0.1319227,-0.134899,-0.0537319],"direction":[0.611414,0.1028575,-0.7845975],"scale":0.0317163,"color":[0,0.61,0.87]},{"id":"GV0DGtZHwjV0","titles":{"EN":"What's Missing?"},"leads":{"EN":"This 1926 dress design followed the risqué higher hemline; showing the wearers’ ankles and calves. Due to the transparent material on the bottom of this garment, our digitization team was unable to create a 3D model of this area."},"articleId":"srGrLW66ivVK","style":"Extended","position":[0.1328149,-0.3335256,0.0612334],"direction":[0.8443696,0.1964272,0.498454],"scale":0.0317163,"color":[0,0.61,0.87]},{"id":"tKG3NF0P4tpt","titles":{"EN":"Design"},"leads":{"EN":"The dress evidences the Art Deco style of geometric and stylized ornament."},"style":"Extended","position":[-0.1360167,0.0399124,0.0267693],"direction":[-0.9390166,0.0114574,0.343681],"scale":0.0317163,"color":[0,0.61,0.87]},{"id":"fwDMSKpyfEKz","titles":{"EN":"Beading"},"leads":{"EN":"Thousands of glass beads decorate this dress which made it quite heavy to wear despite the lightness of the dresses’ pink silk slip."},"style":"Extended","position":[-0.0031738,-0.0292131,-0.1017836],"direction":[0.1450411,0.2166566,-0.9654134],"scale":0.0317163,"color":[0,0.61,0.87]},{"id":"ef6r8FmixSbK","titles":{"EN":"Attached Slip"},"leads":{"EN":"The attached slip provided coverage and structure for the fine lace fabric."},"style":"Extended","position":[0.1405547,0.2784143,-0.0774481],"direction":[0.3490694,0.1181203,-0.9296226],"scale":0.0317163,"color":[0,0.61,0.87]}]}],"metas":[{"collection":{"edanRecordId":"edanmdm:nmah_365586","title":"dress, 1-piece","titles":{"EN":"dress, 1-piece"}},"articles":[{"id":"HEJowGD0VOzZ","uris":{"EN":"articles/catalog-data.html"},"titles":{"EN":"Catalog Data"},"leads":{"EN":""}},{"id":"srGrLW66ivVK","uris":{"EN":"articles/hemline.html"},"titles":{"EN":"Hemline"},"leads":{"EN":""}}]},{"collection":{"edanRecordId":"edanmdm:nma